Q: NavigationStack within a NavigationSplitView show unexpected behavior A: <p>The inspector can be kept visible if the same flag is used for showing an inspector attached to <code>Page2ContentView</code> too. This means passing it as a binding to nested views.</p>
<p>The example is a bit complicated because <code>Page2View</code> contains <code>Page2ContentView</code> as a nested view, but then <code>Page2ContentView</code> can have another instance of <code>Page2ContentView</code> as a navigation destination, and so on.</p>
<ul>
<li><p>For the top level <code>Page2View</code>, the inspector and toolbar need to be attached to <code>VStack</code> as you were doing already and not to the (first) <code>Page2ContentView</code> that is nested inside the <code>VStack</code>.</p>
</li>
<li><p>For child instances of <code>Page2ContentView</code>, the inspector and toolbar need to be attached to these instances directly. This can be done inside the <code>.navigationDestination</code> closure.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Here is how the example can be updated to work this way:</p>
<pre class="lang-swift prettyprint-override"><code>// Page2View

NavigationStack {
    Page2ContentView(folderName: &quot;Main&quot;, showsInspector: $showsInspector) // 👈 pass flag as binding
}
</code></pre>
<pre class="lang-swift prettyprint-override"><code>struct Page2ContentView: View {

    // ...

    @Binding var showsInspector: Bool // 👈 added

    var body: some View {
        Table(someFolders, selection: $selection) {
            // ...
        }
        .contextMenu(forSelectionType: Folder.ID.self) {
            // ...
        }
        .navigationDestination(item: $openedFolderId) { value in
            Page2ContentView(folderName: &quot;\(folderName) - \(value.name)&quot;, showsInspector: $showsInspector) // 👈 + binding
                .inspector(isPresented: $showsInspector) { // 👈 added
                    Text(&quot;Inspector&quot;)
                }
                .toolbar { // 👈 added
                    Button {
                        showsInspector.toggle()
                    } label: {
                        Image(systemName: &quot;sidebar.right&quot;)
                    }
                }
        }
        .navigationTitle(folderName)
    }
}
</code></pre>
